Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,-- Usagi Drop Episode 03 --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:04.70,Main,Tv,0000,0000,0000,,Those of you with Type B, listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:09.69,Main,Tv,0000,0000,0000,,Should this be left alone, it will surely threaten the fabric of your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.69,0:00:10.82,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Turn it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.82,0:00:13.02,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Turn off that sick show!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.47,0:00:19.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't that scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.11,0:00:23.96,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we take a bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.76,0:00:26.93,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Will I die too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:27.38,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:32.72,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean? You're only six years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.59,0:00:39.85,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Whoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:11.86,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(591,287)}Presented by:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:11.86,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(775,287)}Taka Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.70,0:02:21.07,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.79,0:02:31.93,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If I don't find a new daycare soon, we'll be in trouble.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:37.37,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You'd think a corporation that employs smart people would think to have a daycare itself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.37,0:02:41.45,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But what kind of country has that?{\i0} {this doesn't seem to follow... what does he mean?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.89,0:02:48.49,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Kawachi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.49,0:02:49.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.82,0:02:54.30,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have a girlfriend, Kawachi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:55.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.13,0:02:57.29,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,You've been rushing home early lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.29,0:02:58.95,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, I don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:02.05,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,You used to always take the last train of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.05,0:03:05.82,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Our sales were out of this world last year, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:07.10,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,But, if you keep this up...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:11.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Those sales figures weren't born out of willpower or determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.86,0:03:13.68,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It was just a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:15.59,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My name means "super lucky," after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:17.30,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:18.81,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.03,0:03:22.26,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Here, I'll take some.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:23.68,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:25.08,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Fourth floor, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.08,0:03:27.39,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. How are things here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.39,0:03:29.04,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This year's been rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.04,0:03:31.38,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, he was just stacking the pressure on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:33.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I think I'm going bald from the stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.92,0:03:36.77,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,It's not easy surpassing your own record, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.31,0:03:42.41,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So, Gotou-san, do you really have a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.41,0:03:44.69,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Don't judge me just because I'm short!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:49.08,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's just you're so thin, I was\Nwondering if you really had a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:50.66,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I can't remember, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:52.83,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,He's already two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:56.00,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, I'll take them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:03:57.94,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,I can carry them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:03:59.82,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:01.08,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:02.64,Main,GOtou,0000,0000,0000,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:07.29,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,She's energetic, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.29,0:04:10.48,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,I wish she was still in sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:13.93,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She was here years before me,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.93,0:04:15.44,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}but during her pregnancy,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.44,0:04:19.43,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}she requested to be demoted so she could get home at the same time every day.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:24.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Other employees would always gossip about her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:29.92,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,What?! For how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.92,0:04:32.74,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not really sure yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.74,0:04:34.42,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.42,0:04:37.61,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's been wetting the bed recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:40.38,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like it really upsets her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:43.14,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's psychological.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:46.82,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Still, kids really do sweat an astonishing amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.82,0:04:49.24,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,But since they can't sweat much during autumn and winter,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:51.07,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,they have to pee a lot more to compensate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.07,0:04:53.69,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah, I remember hearing that as a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.69,0:04:56.34,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"Make sure you pee before going to bed."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.34,0:05:00.36,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Her mother must have had a good reason to leave her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:03.63,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I wish I could ask her some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.63,0:05:06.63,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess having a mother is really important, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.63,0:05:08.71,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Men shouldn't give in so easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.70,0:05:09.62,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.07,0:05:13.01,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What'd you do today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.86,0:05:18.57,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I read picture books and had staring contests...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:23.36,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you have fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.34,0:05:24.63,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What's she doing?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.84,0:05:30.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I'll make dinner right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.10,0:05:37.69,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The moon's fading away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:42.11,Handbook,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(775,248)}Maternity and Child\NCare Handbook
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:42.11,Names,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\pos(637,544)}Kaga Souichi
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:42.11,Names,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\pos(628,572)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:42.11,Names,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\pos(584,600)}Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.81,0:05:50.40,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:52.03,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,So, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:54.33,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.33,0:05:55.73,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't asking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.73,0:05:58.38,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, she's fine too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:06:02.46,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on, I thought you didn't want to get involved with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:05.79,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I have to get involved. You're watching over her, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:13.49,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna try to find Rin's mom this weekend, so I'll be on your side of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.49,0:06:17.34,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Call me when you're at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.34,0:06:19.70,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Make sure you dress her properly for the cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:22.52,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right. I'll call Haruko too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.52,0:06:25.07,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Our two kids seem to get along well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.76,0:06:30.87,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We passed another car!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.18,0:06:33.69,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Seems like you're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.70,0:06:35.08,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:40.50,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.36,0:06:44.30,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.29,0:06:46.00,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's good to see you, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:48.09,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.55,0:06:58.23,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, I don't have anything a child would like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.23,0:07:03.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She likes things adults do anyway. Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:05.02,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Finished already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.02,0:07:05.90,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.90,0:07:08.49,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't complain if you get hungry again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:10.92,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm full.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.78,0:07:14.87,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry I didn't finish my plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.36,0:07:19.15,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home! Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:27.87,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,What a drag! What's with that family?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.12,0:07:33.80,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,Brother, you really took this girl in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:37.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:41.55,Main,Tv,0000,0000,0000,,And here's the forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.55,0:07:45.31,Main,Tv,0000,0000,0000,,It will be warm and sunny across the nation today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:48.86,Main,Tv,0000,0000,0000,,Temperatures will be about two degrees higher than usual for this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:50.82,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just going to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.82,0:07:53.27,Main,Tv,0000,0000,0000,,Now then, on to tomorrow's forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:08:00.41,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm using the bathroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:09.80,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I can't go if you're right outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.14,0:08:13.70,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,Is she always like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:18.81,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, she's actually pretty chatty at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.80,0:08:22.22,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She even acted like going on the train was some kind of trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.23,0:08:28.69,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But, all the adults here last time were really tense around her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:31.40,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,What did we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:37.24,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot. If adults are in a bad mood, kids think they're angry at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.52,0:08:44.00,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,He's right. You two were like that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:48.44,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,See! You used to be exactly like her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:51.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But Rin's smarter than you were!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:51.76,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,Shut it, baldie! {bald man}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.41,0:09:03.72,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, you like cat's cradle, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.54,0:09:08.68,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Go on, give an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:09.48,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.39,0:09:12.35,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:19.28,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.42,0:09:23.73,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Now watch your Auntie do it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:26.92,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I think you mean "Grandma," don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.83,0:09:30.34,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You don't look old enough to be my grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:33.30,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my! What a nice girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.30,0:09:36.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Her basis for what counts as old is lopsided, that's all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.55,0:09:38.00,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Now watch me do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:43.99,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Did I make a mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:47.94,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.23,0:09:51.26,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did you want to do a four-step ladder?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.26,0:09:52.60,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.28,0:09:56.61,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Two-step ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:09:58.57,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Airplane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.57,0:09:59.98,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.98,0:10:01.49,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.49,0:10:04.11,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:05.41,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:08.41,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's easy with this string.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:09.75,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did you make this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.75,0:10:12.75,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I knitted it from thin wool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.75,0:10:16.74,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Its weight balance is much better than simply making loops out of the wool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:17.99,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.97,0:10:20.43,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Since she's good with her hands,\Nmaybe she can play with beanbags!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.72,0:10:24.76,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You hang it on your pinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.76,0:10:26.68,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:27.68,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.84,0:10:34.72,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,One went up, two came down... {i don't really know what song she's singing, so i just made one up using the words she says lol}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.72,0:10:37.17,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,What on earth is going on in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.17,0:10:39.56,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:41.87,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.87,0:10:43.01,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.01,0:10:44.69,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Probably Haruko-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.70,0:10:47.08,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:49.48,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,These are pretty! What are they called?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.48,0:10:50.71,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Beanbags.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:54.30,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:55.35,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:59.13,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You're really doing great, raising a child and working at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:03.53,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,My husband doesn't help out at home at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.51,0:11:05.56,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Are you heading over to Grandpa's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:10.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I figured I might find\Nsomething there about Rin's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:11.06,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.05,0:11:14.96,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Having a mother is important, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:08.85,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That's strange.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:11.50,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You should've at least left a will behind, Grandpa.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:14.44,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Weren't you worried about what would happen to Rin?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:26.84,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}A modem?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:30.31,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:34.76,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that look?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.42,0:12:38.47,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I got it done the same as Reina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.47,0:12:40.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you get new clothes too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.86,0:12:42.48,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're Kazumi's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.48,0:12:44.19,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you say Kazumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.19,0:12:48.67,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,Mom, you can't dress her up in old-fashioned clothes like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.67,0:12:52.09,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,But look how nice she looks in them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.80,0:12:56.08,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.08,0:12:59.90,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,They only look good because of her figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.88,0:13:02.51,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,It sure brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:02.51,Overlap,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Any luck at Grandpa's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:05.85,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nope, none.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.85,0:13:07.19,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.19,0:13:11.35,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Still, I think it's best not to rush\N to press the issue with Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.35,0:13:15.48,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I can tell you're trying hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:18.59,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure whether we ever told you or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.59,0:13:21.96,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,but your mother started working after you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:25.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? She wasn't always a housewife?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:30.91,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,She pushed herself too far when pregnant with Kazumi, and had to be hospitalized for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:35.64,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,When she went back to work, they had removed her position completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.58,0:13:39.57,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,She felt really down after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.57,0:13:42.25,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,And because Kazumi was so tiny when she was born,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.25,0:13:47.72,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,your mother would leave work early and come home to look after you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.60,0:13:50.71,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What about Kazumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.71,0:13:54.22,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Your mother made doting on Kazumi her top priority,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.22,0:13:57.52,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,making her the arrogant woman she is today. {meaning kazumi}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.09,0:14:03.94,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Will you be okay? Do you want Dad to take you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.94,0:14:06.02,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine. We'll just make it if we walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.83,0:14:16.50,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can we come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.41,0:14:20.21,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She wants to know if she can come again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:29.01,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be waiting for you, so come any time you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.01,0:14:30.78,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.91,0:14:38.96,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.96,0:14:41.47,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I just thought it'd be nice to have a grandchild!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:43.11,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'd take care of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.11,0:14:45.97,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,I can't work and raise a child at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.98,0:14:48.15,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,That's when women get left behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.15,0:14:51.70,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, I still want to fit into a swimsuit and go out drinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.75,0:14:59.26,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, did Grandpa have a computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.25,0:15:01.08,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know what that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.08,0:15:02.13,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:04.25,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did Grandpa use one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.25,0:15:06.38,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No, the maid did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:08.29,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,He had a maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:10.68,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Her name was Masako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:12.34,Handbook3,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(582,106)}Maternity and Child\NCare Handbook
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:12.34,Names2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.3\pos(757,403)}Kaga Souichi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:12.34,Names2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.3\pos(767,426)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:12.34,Names2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.3\pos(767,468)}Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.96,0:15:17.64,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What was she like?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:21.60,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can't really remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.36,0:15:40.35,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I hate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:44.91,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She was always angry at me. She hated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.91,0:15:49.02,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I forgot about her because she scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.67,0:15:53.12,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.94,0:15:57.57,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I know it's a little late to be saying this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:16:01.39,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but it really is hard working while raising a kid, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.39,0:16:04.10,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,You said it. It sure keeps us busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.29,0:16:12.50,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Gotou-san, have you ever thought you sacrificed a lot to raise your child?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.49,0:16:13.95,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Like when I asked to be demoted?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.95,0:16:17.45,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, I know this must sound rude...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.45,0:16:21.16,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Well, back then I thought it was the best choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.16,0:16:23.62,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,and things turned out alright in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.55,0:16:33.13,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I have sacrificed myself, it's not something I'd want to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.13,0:16:35.81,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Words carry power within them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.81,0:16:37.92,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,You know, like the soul of language.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.92,0:16:40.29,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Or is that too abstract?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.29,0:16:43.48,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, I completely understand what you mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.39,0:16:47.69,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Please give me more advice about raising a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.55,0:16:51.69,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-kun, your child's older than mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.69,0:16:55.11,Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,You're my senior in that regard. You should advise me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.97,0:17:24.85,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, it's okay to wake me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.85,0:17:26.80,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But it's just sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:29.81,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care if it's sweat or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:35.41,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you have a scary dream? {he doesn't say 'nightmare' here. i think 'scary dream' fits more when you're talking with a child}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.03,0:17:39.77,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What does dying feel like?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.82,0:17:43.73,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, are you going to die before I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.87,0:17:48.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Her sadness over Grandpa's death...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:50.79,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Her worry over what'll happen if I die too...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:54.67,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Her fear of dying herself...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.67,0:18:00.39,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She can't deal with all those things individually, so she lets them pile up inside of her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.66,0:18:05.02,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Everything will be fine until you're a young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.16,0:18:08.18,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,When's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:12.69,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, everything will be fine until you're a grown-up woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:15.44,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I won't die until then!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.44,0:18:17.42,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.32,0:18:21.24,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.12,0:18:24.43,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And don't worry about wetting the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.43,0:18:26.94,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It'll stop if you go to the bathroom before sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.94,0:18:28.47,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But the bathroom's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:30.21,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll go with you at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.21,0:18:34.80,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And even if you still wet the bed, all we have to do is change your pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:38.22,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You won't be mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.22,0:18:42.85,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I won't be mad. Nor will I laugh about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:45.77,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.26,0:18:49.76,Main,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,So, what'd you want to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.77,0:18:52.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry for suddenly bringing this up, Hidaka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.90,0:18:55.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I know this is really unexpected,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:58.88,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but could you please transfer me to a section with no overtime?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:19:02.62,Main,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,What? Are you serious, Kawachi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:05.03,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,As serious as it gets!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:09.29,Main,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,I see, so that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.29,0:19:11.79,Main,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,In my opinion, this'll be a real loss for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.79,0:19:14.56,Main,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,But, I have a child as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.56,0:19:18.04,Main,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try to convince the section head to grant your request.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.05,0:19:21.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm truly sorry. Thank you for understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:25.10,Main,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,Still, your subordinates won't be too happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:26.72,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,I can't accept that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.72,0:19:28.77,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you have to do it, Kawachi-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.77,0:19:31.26,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you ask one of your relatives?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.26,0:19:33.71,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I guess I shouldn't tell him that I chose to watch over her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.71,0:19:38.16,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, aren't there daycares that stay open until late at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.15,0:19:41.20,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to work for someone other than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:44.31,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Look, I know this is really sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.31,0:19:48.19,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but managers and the like transfer suddenly all the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.19,0:19:49.61,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Stop making a big deal out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:56.03,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Still, I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.71,0:20:01.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even if I'm not there, things will\Neventually settle down in my section.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.13,0:20:02.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}They'll move people around.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.55,0:20:04.34,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Otherwise something would be off with the company.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.34,0:20:07.51,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But I can't keep making Rin go on like this.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.51,0:20:12.85,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm sure I'm doing the right thing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.85,0:20:13.81,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Probably...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:16.23,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is it done?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.23,0:20:18.17,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Is this enough rice for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.15,0:20:19.28,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.28,0:20:19.40,Admi,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.7\pos(724,445)}Admissions Guide
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:19.53,Admi2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.7\pos(731,468)}Admissions Guide
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.53,0:20:19.65,Admi3,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.7\pos(738,491)}Admissions Guide
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.65,0:20:19.78,Admi4,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.7\pos(757,530)}Admissions Guide
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.78,0:20:19.90,Admi5,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.7\pos(772,573)}Admissions Guide
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:20.07,Admi6,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.7\pos(783,592)}Admissions Guide
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.07,0:20:27.24,Admi7,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.7\pos(792,609)}Admissions Guide
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.28,0:20:23.57,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Towel, lunch box, slippers, toothbrush, cup...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.57,0:20:24.81,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,With your name on them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.81,0:20:25.64,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Futon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:27.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's only for babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.23,0:20:28.60,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.65,0:20:35.16,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.79,0:20:43.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I can't say I'm not sacrificing anything\Nright now, without it sounding like a lie,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.05,0:20:48.84,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}but I hope one day I'll be able to say it out loud.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.64,0:22:24.68,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, what is this you've got all over your towel and lunch box?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.68,0:22:28.16,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That dog with huge ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.15,0:22:29.41,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's not a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.82,0:22:33.28,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a lop-ear! {type of rabbit}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.28,0:22:35.28,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Lop-what? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.28,0:22:36.62,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a rabbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.62,0:22:39.16,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? So it's not a dog with spots?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.16,0:22:40.24,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a rabbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.33,0:22:42.54,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.62,0:22:51.16,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, it's bathroom time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.16,0:22:53.04,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I already went.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.04,0:22:54.15,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.15,0:22:56.15,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
